{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-xiaomi-33w-power-bank-20000mah-with-integrated-cable-2510-0232","content_id":"d52f04e9-1b6c-420a-903d-e323236db276","description":"Product Recall for Xiaomi 33W Power Bank 20000mAh with Integrated Cable presenting a risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"52607940-9438-4676-9bea-a3fc58a0956a","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-12-22T15:13:49+00:00","id":"52607940-9438-4676-9bea-a3fc58a0956a","title":"Product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-12-22T15:20:07+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6949602d72075a1d4a5089fd/2510-0232-product-recall-xiaomi-power-bank.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Xiaomi 33W Power Bank 20000mAh with Integrated Cable</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as the lithium-ion batteries can overheat whilst in use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Power Bank</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Xiaomi</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>PB2030MI</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Colours</td>\n      <td>Tan and Blue</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturing dates</td>\n      <td>August to September 2024</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Portable charger designed to charge electronics.  For a list of affected S/N codes, please see Annex A in the PDF attached below</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_52607940-9438-4676-9bea-a3fc58a0956a\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6949602d72075a1d4a5089fd/2510-0232-product-recall-xiaomi-power-bank.pdf\">Product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as the lithium-ion batteries can overheat whilst in use. This can lead to localised smoking, melting and/or a risk of fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<p>Owners are advised to stop using the product immediately and visit:  <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.mi.com/uk/support/safety-notice/?srsltid=AfmBOor2zeB29MqlvNs-8I0_YalZ0lv36Ja3Re_RCZ70HRnBbmEhH_k_\">Xiaomi Recall Page</a> to register for a refund or replacement.</p>\n\n<p>Xiaomi are contacting affected end customers to alert them to the risks.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2510-0232</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-12-23T09:54:38Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-12-23","product_risk_level":"not-provided"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-12-23T09:54:38+00:00","links":{"available_trans